@startuml requirement-lifecycle

title Requirement Lifecycle State Diagram

[*] --> Created : New requirement defined

Created --> Ready : Requirement reviewed\nand baselined

Ready --> InReview : Technical review\ninitiated

InReview --> Accepted : Review approved
InReview --> Ready : Minor changes\nrequired
InReview --> Rejected : Major issues\nidentified

Accepted --> Obsolete : Requirement no\nlonger needed

Rejected --> Created : Rework and\nresubmit
Rejected --> Obsolete : Permanently\nrejected

Obsolete --> [*]

note right of Created
Initial state when
requirement is first
documented
end note

note right of Accepted
Requirement is approved
and ready for implementation.
Cannot be changed without
change control process.
end note

note right of Obsolete
Requirement is no longer
valid or has been superseded
by another requirement.
end note

@enduml